      "parameters": {
        "resource": "image",
        "operation": "edit",
        "prompt": "={\n  \"prompt\": \"Create a photorealistic composite image by placing the vehicle from data2 into the dealership scene from data1. IMPORTANT MODIFICATIONS TO BACKGROUND: Remove completely the red metal barriers/fencing in the foreground, remove the stone wall barrier, and clean up the street area to create a clear, professional dealership foreground. COMPOSITION REQUIREMENTS: Position the vehicle in the foreground of the Beta Motor Cars dealership as if it's on display in front of the showroom. Ensure the vehicle maintains its exact appearance, color, and details from the original image. LIGHTING AND REALISM: Match the lighting conditions perfectly - the scene has bright daylight with blue sky and white clouds, so adjust the vehicle's lighting, shadows, and reflections accordingly. Create realistic shadows cast by the vehicle on the clean pavement surface. Add natural reflections on the vehicle's surface that match the sky, clouds, and surrounding environment. Ensure the vehicle's scale and perspective align perfectly with the dealership building in the background. FINAL REQUIREMENTS: The result must look like a professional dealership stock photograph taken on a clear day, with the vehicle prominently displayed in front of the Beta Motor Cars showroom. The integration must be seamless with no visible compositing artifacts. Output high resolution suitable for commercial advertising and online listings.\",\n\n  \"settings\": {\n    \"resolution\": \"high\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\",\n    \"quality\": \"maximum\",\n    \"style\": \"photorealistic\"\n  },\n  \"instructions_summary\": {\n    \"es\": \"Colocar vehículo de data2 en fondo de concesionario data1, eliminando vallas rojas y muro de piedra, con iluminación y reflejos realistas\"\n  }\n}\n",
